    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Dreamer’s Poise.</strong> Your inner life harmonizes with the symbolic architecture of the world. Turbulence washes over you without breaking your Clarity hold.</p><ul><li>You gain a +1 bonus to Body check.</li><li>You reroll the lowest die on defense checks against becoming <strong>stunned</strong> or <strong>confused</strong> (GM discretion for mental effects).</li><li>You cannot roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 imposed on Insight (Soul) checks, unless you are unconscious.</li></ul><p>Bad Eden engines may treat you as a stabilizing anchor for slippage zones, psychic anomalies, and metaphysical turbulence.</p>",
